2026-11-11 08:44:35,422 INFO mulder.orchestrator.display: [dashboard] ### **Confirmed Discoveries:**
2026-11-11 08:44:35,422 INFO mulder.orchestrator.display: [dashboard] 1. **Comprehensive Hacking Toolkit** - System contains 10+ installed hacking tools (Cain & Abel, mIRC, Ethereal, Network Stumbler, WinPcap, Anonymizer, Look@LAN, Whois, CuteFTP, Agent newsreader) plus additional staged tools in My Documents directories organized by attack phase (footprinting, enumeration, exploitation).
2026-11-11 08:44:35,423 INFO mulder.orchestrator.display: [dashboard] 2. **Suspicious User Account** - Primary user account registered as "Mr. Evil" with administrator-level privileges and direct evidence of hacking tool execution.
