2026-11-11 08:44:35,424 INFO mulder.orchestrator.display: [dashboard] 4. **Network Reconnaissance Infrastructure** - Look@LAN network scanner, NMAP, Ethereal packet analyzer, and Network Stumbler wireless scanner installed and partially executed.
